{%- comment -%}
  Renders a feature icon (exact Figma / Hugeicons vectors) for the Feature strip (H1) section.

  Accepts:
  - icon: {String} Icon name: lake, laptop, expand, shield, circle-lock
  - size: {Number} Pixel size (optional, default 24)

  Usage:
  {%- render 'icon-feature-h1', icon: 'lake' -%}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign size = size | default: 24
-%}

{%- case icon -%}
